      /* ---- Compute the upper-triangular part of row i (including diag) ----
         For fixed i, each A[i][j] with j >= i depends only on:
           - A[i][0..i-1] (already fixed by the previous loop), and
           - A[k][j] for k < i (rows < i already completed).
